:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] rounded-s-none" style="aspect-ratio:auto;padding-inline:4px;min-width:0" aria-label="More options" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_r9icqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 "><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-fill-secondary group-hover/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-secondary stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-secondary stacks:group-hover/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-2-fill-button-layer stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-3-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-fill-disabled stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-disabled stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-none stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:layers-2-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-2-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="text-muted" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></div></div></div><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><p>Jailbreaking and prompt injection are attempts to make Claude ignore its guidelines or your instructions. Although Claude is inherently resilient to such attacks, the additional steps on this page strengthen your guardrails, particularly against uses that violate Anthropic’s <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/legal/commercial-terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms of Service</a> or <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/legal/aup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Usage Policy</a>.</p>
<p>These attacks fall into two categories with different threat models:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Jailbreaks and direct prompt injection</strong>, where the <em>user</em> of your application is the adversary and crafts inputs intended to bypass your guardrails.</li>
<li><strong>Indirect prompt injection</strong>, where the user is trusted but Claude processes <em>third-party content</em> (webpages, emails, documents, tool results) that contains adversarial instructions.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="jailbreaks-and-direct-prompt-injection" class="group">Jailbreaks and direct prompt injection<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Jailbreaks and direct prompt injection" id="_R_51vcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h2>
<p>In this threat model, a user is deliberately crafting inputs to manipulate your application into producing content or taking actions you don’t want it to. These mitigations strengthen your application’s guardrails:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Harmlessness screens:</strong> Use a lightweight model such as Claude Haiku 5.5 to pre-screen user input before it reaches your main conversation. Use <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/structured-outputs">structured outputs</a> to constrain the response to a simple classification. Claude Haiku 5.5 runs <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/refusals-and-fallback">safety classifiers</a> that can decline the screening request itself, so treat a response with <code>stop_reason: &quot;refusal&quot;</code> as a harmful verdict.</p>
