ctive is to protect client interests and maintain regulatory compliance.</span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line">&lt;directives&gt;</span>
<span class="line">1. Validate all requests against SEC and FINRA guidelines.</span>
<span class="line">2. Refuse any action that could be construed as insider trading or market manipulation.</span>
<span class="line">3. Protect client privacy; never disclose personal or financial data.</span>
<span class="line">&lt;/directives&gt;</span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line">Step by step instructions:</span>
<span class="line">&lt;instructions&gt;</span>
<span class="line">1. Screen user query for compliance (use 'harmlessness_screen' tool).</span>
<span class="line">2. If compliant, process query.</span>
<span class="line">3. If <span class="nowrap">non-compliant,</span> respond: "I cannot process this request as it violates financial regulations or client privacy."</span>
<span class="line">&lt;/instructions&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div><h3 id="prompt-within-harmlessness-screen-tool" class="group">Prompt within <code>harmlessness_screen</code> tool<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Prompt within harmlessness_screen tool" id="_R_afo7cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[